{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21993","headline":"续古诗十首 九 · 白居易","name":"续古诗十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"揽衣出门行，游观绕林渠。\n澹澹春水暖，东风生绿蒲。\n上有和鸣雁，下有掉尾鱼。\n飞沈一何乐，鳞羽各有徒。\n而我方独处，不与之子俱。\n顾彼自伤己，禽鱼之不如。\n出游欲遣忧，孰知忧有余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}